{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"x":0.094650205779984162,"t":"Test 6","y":0.074127906819212441,"w":0.061728394826253266,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"y":0.2630813950728732,"t":"F","x":0.094650205621096759,"w":0.014403292338053389,"h":0.014534883982160629,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.47674418581994626,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.018518517812093085,"x":0.096707819197519987,"t":"G"},{"w":0.75943634033203133,"h":0.022434524428296854,"x":0.13982180097674926,"t":"We should remember, however, that Lost City of the Incas is a work of hindsight,","y":0.11786834690306902,"c":1},{"t":"not written until 1948, many years after his journey. His journal entries of the","h":0.019587634730254821,"y":0.13650778374330019,"c":1,"x":0.13984716572867123,"w":0.71825866699218732},{"h":0.018450796533950764,"c":1,"y":0.15434852462263438,"w":0.72033594767252596,"t":"time reveal a much more gradual appreciation of his achievement. He spent","x":0.13983244302276612},{"t":"the afternoon at the ruins noting down the dimensions of some of the buildings,","x":0.1399176914729035,"w":0.74897120157877595,"y":0.17285041234654774,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017484660423827014,"t":"then descended and rejoined his companions, to whom he seems to have said","y":0.1904069765834473,"x":0.13991769229724382,"w":0.74279836018880219},{"x":0.14188442494327347,"h":0.020889947215014026,"y":0.20715184992209323,"t":"little about his discovery. At this stage, Bingham didn't realise the extent or the","w":0.7347645060221355,"c":1},{"t":"importance of the site, nor did he realise what use he could make of the discovery.","h":0.019678242776643873,"w":0.77789744059244792,"c":1,"x":0.1398511052781572,"y":0.2250655330826965},{"t":"However, soon after returning it occurred to him that he could make a name for","h":0.023492357054082591,"w":0.74524607340494797,"c":1,"x":0.14179286244283312,"y":0.25785516929462382},{"w":0.71826121012369792,"t":"himself from this discovery. When he came to write the National Geographic","h":0.018856417023531913,"x":0.14190339398441079,"c":1,"y":0.27846260199002737},{"w":0.74709660847981774,"t":"magazine article that broke the story to the world in April 1913, he knew he had","y":0.29638940585856854,"h":0.019520073251533265,"x":0.1418946748318792,"c":1},{"x":0.14183118559325919,"y":0.3124779767706346,"w":0.75957168579101553,"t":"to produce a big idea. He wondered whether it could have been the birthplace of","c":1,"h":0.021188578701131666},{"w":0.74094507853190095,"c":1,"h":0.019725729916486134,"y":0.33184146114790325,"t":"the very first Inca, Manco the Great, and whether it could also have been what","x":0.1418796241648253},{"x":0.1419752999002005,"y":0.35029069752519026,"c":1,"h":0.016022611984235047,"t":"chroniclers described as 'the last city of the Incas'. This term refers to Vilcabamba,","w":0.77983540852864575},{"w":0.72239557902018214,"h":0.019810713643319988,"c":1,"y":0.36721191443373535,"x":0.1418762315182347,"t":"the settlement where the Incas had fled from Spanish invaders in the 1530s."},{"w":0.76553181966145822,"t":"Bingham made desperate attempts to prove this belief for nearly 40 years. Sadly,","x":0.14397422604483162,"h":0.019098171777803818,"c":1,"y":0.38505853216320163},{"c":1,"t":"his vision of the site as both the beginning and end of the Inca civilisation, while","x":0.14197531279501108,"w":0.75102879842122394,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.40400471131461146},{"h":0.020856983108430649,"c":1,"t":"a magnificent one, is inaccurate. We now know that Vilcabamba actually lies 65","y":0.4198279551100742,"w":0.75128051757812497,"x":0.14187002370266422},{"y":0.43895348855897698,"t":"kilometres away in the depths of the jungle.","x":0.14197531959087853,"h":0.017465828445129006,"c":1,"w":0.41563784281412763},{"c":1,"x":0.14393111402152992,"w":0.76977294921874995,"t":"One question that has perplexed visitors, historians and archaeologists alike ever","h":0.021146129522784052,"y":0.47326126081051201},{"t":"since Bingham, is why the site seems to have been abandoned before the Spanish","w":0.7842029825846355,"x":0.14389451119703817,"y":0.48955793923522117,"h":0.022811918854011348,"c":1},{"h":0.018552123587600389,"c":1,"x":0.14397073609289862,"y":0.50922623739030493,"t":"Conquest. There are no references to it by any of the Spanish chroniclers - and if","w":0.77175984700520828},{"c":1,"t":"they had known of its existence so close to Cusco they would certainly have come","x":0.14392929718497158,"w":0.77592493693033848,"y":0.52681313693795073,"h":0.020165046898580119},{"c":1,"y":0.54444789466499288,"h":0.020290120892024865,"t":"in search of gold. An idea which has gained wide acceptance over the past few","x":0.14189309368314448,"w":0.74916478474934889},{"w":0.77800267537434897,"c":1,"y":0.56259649296487246,"h":0.020292450598187739,"t":"years is that Machu Picchu was a moya, a country estate built by an Inca emperor","x":0.14390964362703718},{"t":"to escape the cold winters of Cusco, where the elite could enjoy monumental","c":1,"x":0.1419753075688853,"y":0.5812720848616838,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.73045267740885411},{"w":0.73868311564127598,"y":0.59883720914104499,"h":0.017476100382451065,"c":1,"x":0.14403292776160215,"t":"architecture and spectacular views. Furthermore, the particular architecture of"},{"t":"Machu Picchu suggests that it was constructed at the time of the greatest of all the","y":0.61604715835763468,"h":0.019754980422021062,"x":0.14394234520686211,"w":0.78206710815429692,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Incas, the emperor Pachacuti (c. 1438-71). By custom, Pachacuti's descendants","y":0.63129252625500398,"w":0.76571233113606785,"h":0.023164234678090923,"x":0.14389825607709505},{"w":0.78395060221354163,"c":1,"t":"built other similar estates for their own use, and so Machu Picchu would have been","x":0.14609054247243308,"y":0.65253239095284254,"h":0.017667844522968212},{"h":0.022954299396564348,"c":1,"x":0.14589620465267236,"y":0.66792125412815906,"t":"abandoned after his death, some 50 years before the Spanish Conquest.","w":0.68962061564127597},{"y":0.94767441843259159,"c":1,"t":"44","x":0.10082304480034679,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.02674897193908693},{"x":0.39483721299237268,"w":0.20824633280436194,"c":1,"h":0.016454192297478354,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258536995222}]}